message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: Sightline
abstract: >-
  Sightline is a self-hosted AI visibility platform. It tracks how AI answer
  engines mention, cite, and describe brands. The project started as a copy of
  Elmo (MIT) and is developed independently.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Sightline contributors
